[FILE:286:descriptions/desc.primary]
Xiphos is a Bible study application for Linux, UNIX, and Windows operating 
systems. It uses Sword to display Bibles, commentaries, dictionary, and 
other texts and images. Xiphos includes features such as, searching, 
biblesync, bookmarks, parallel study, and original language study.


